<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Kudu Granite posts half yr attrib loss.</title>
<headline>Kudu Granite posts half yr attrib loss.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     54.4 loss   vs 19.9 profit</p>
<p>    Pre-excep shr (cts)   3.9	   vs 18.3</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   23.38 loss  vs 8.30 profit</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   23.38 loss  vs 7.65 profit</p>
<p>    Tax			 nil	   vs 0.64</p>
<p>    Financing costs	 3.69	  vs 6.51</p>
<p>    Turnover		  66.95	 vs 116.06</p>
<p>Full name: Kudu Granite Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>Adjustments from review of accounting estimates</p>
<p>				  25.05	 vs nil</p>
<p>* Latest results are compared to those for the year to June 30 1996. The company said profits for the year to December 31 were expected to exceed those for the year to June 1996.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
